warning: the spec declares no security scheme, so no auth is written and requests go out anonymous: if the API takes a token, add data.presets.paging.auth in an overrides file
8 screens, 8 sources
note: GET /pages: the response has no total, so it walks every page rather than windowing
note: GET /twice: more than one parameter could page it, so it walks rather than windows
note: 6 lists walk every page, up to 20 (raise max_pages in overrides)
